    {
      "section": "dsh-expert-group",
      "text": "[中文](README.md) | **English**\n\nThis project is a subagent plugin for DeepSeek Harness (dsh), in the spirit of omo-slim. The parent agent decomposes tasks, delegates to experts, merges the results, and verifies them; the plugin provides role-based experts with configurable models (every expert can have fallback models and peak/off-peak models), a task sidebar, model configuration, task notifications, and session deletion."
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-expert-group",
      "text": "> This English edition is a translation of [README.md](README.md); if the two versions ever disagree, the Chinese version is authoritative."
